END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:PJM 101: The Basics is an overview course introducing participa
 nts to PJM's markets and operations models.
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260818
DTSTAMP:20260702T091741Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260818
LOCATION:8/18/2026
SEQUENCE:118791394
SUMMARY:PJM 101: The Basics
UID:b4881bf2-f9c4-4b9c-b70a-7274c6f986df
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:This one-day course provides an in-depth look at the components
  of locational marginal pricing (LMP) including the shadow price.
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260819
DTSTAMP:20260702T091741Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260819
LOCATION:8/19/2026
SEQUENCE:118791402
SUMMARY:LMP/FTR
UID:ae0f550a-babb-49e9-b4b7-7821a6b41475
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:This two-day course includes an introduction to the Market Sett
 lements process at PJM.
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260827
DTSTAMP:20260702T091741Z
