LOCATION:8/27/2026
SEQUENCE:118791411
SUMMARY:Market Settlements
UID:4e0bf44d-e688-40b3-a219-cd4d89473def
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:PJM 101: The Basics is an overview course introducing participa
 nts to PJM's markets and operations models.
