SUMMARY:PJM 101: The Basics
UID:70ce6ddf-6e35-40b4-9960-64c7a503f010
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:The Load Serving Entity 101 course is an entire day of basic to
 pics dedicated to a Load Serving Entity participation in PJM.
