LOCATION:9/10/2026
SEQUENCE:118791438
SUMMARY:Load Serving Entity 101
UID:5158525d-a31d-4462-b103-6b14a05c14c3
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:This course will provide a general overview of the actual compo
 nents that make up the Power Grid.
