LOCATION:9/17/2026
SEQUENCE:118791448
SUMMARY:Power System Elements
UID:02645284-7615-4018-af52-d84092032fab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Review the topics of real and reactive power flow\, maximum pow
 er transfer\, steady state\, dynamic and transient stability\, local and i
 nter-area oscillations\, and the equal-area criterion.
